The '''Mole''' is a monster added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''.

It chases Isaac by burrowing in the ground (characterized by small, moving rubble on the surface). When it gets near Isaac, it pokes out of the ground and fires 3 blood shots at him. It will then jump to a nearby tile leaving a {{E|Poop}} where it jumped.
{{clear}}

== Variations ==
=== Tainted Mole ===
