The '''Tainted Mole''' is a stronger, distorted version of the regular mole.

It burrows through the ground, creating rockwaves in the direction it moves in. When it gets near Isaac, it pokes out of the ground, creating a ring of rock waves (similar to the {{E|Roundy}}) and fires 3 blood shots at him 4 times. It will then jump to a nearby tile leaving a {{E|Poop}} where it jumped. {{clear}}

